<%# The body of the message only — emails/layout.html.erb wraps it, and the
    unsubscribe link lives in that footer. Colours are inline as well as in the
    layout's stylesheet, for the clients that drop a <style> block. %>
<p class="first" style="color:#d8e0e8">You've been invited to <strong><%= club ? club.name : "Boxd Club" %></strong>.</p>
<p style="color:#d8e0e8">We read everyone's public Letterboxd watchlist, put the films the most of us already want to see on a ballot, and you rank them. There's no deadline — the round closes when everyone has voted. Then you watch the winner and log it on Letterboxd, and the next round opens once everyone has.</p>
<%= Mailer.button(verify_url, "Set yourself up") %>
<p class="meta last" style="color:#8b9aa8;font-size:14px">You'll need a public Letterboxd watchlist.</p>
